+{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CdP3ma2prkuWMw15fGxk8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JghP94zZmAYAv83ievrHyi","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"delegate light \"Write a TypeScript file. Output ONLY raw TypeScript code, no markdown fences, no explanation.\n\nFile: src/inventory/index.ts for a Node16-module strict-TypeScript project.\n\nImports (exact):\nimport { EventBus } from '../bus.js';\nimport { InventoryService, Events } from '../types.js';\n\nThe interface to implement:\nexport interface InventoryService {\n  setStock(productId: string, quantity: number): void;\n  getStock(productId: string): number;\n  reserve(productId: string, quantity: number): boolean;\n  release(productId: string, quantity: number): void;\n  setLowStockThreshold(productId: string, threshold: number): void;\n}\n\nRequirements:\n- Export exactly: export function createInventoryService(bus: EventBus): InventoryService\n- Two Maps in the factory closure: stock = Map<string, number>, thresholds = Map<string, number>.\n- Helper emitUpdate(productId): void bus.emit(Events.INVENTORY_UPDATED, { productId, quantity: stock.get(productId) ?? 0 });\n- Helper checkLowStock(productId): const threshold = thresholds.get(productId); if threshold is not undefined and (stock.get(productId) ?? 0) < threshold, then void bus.emit(Events.LOW_STOCK_ALERT, { productId, currentQuantity: stock.get(productId) ?? 0, threshold });\n- setStock: stock.set(productId, quantity); emitUpdate; checkLowStock.\n- getStock: return stock.get(productId) ?? 0.\n- reserve: current = stock.get(productId) ?? 0; if current < quantity return false; stock.set(productId, current - quantity); emitUpdate; checkLowStock; return true.\n- release: stock.set(productId, (stock.get(productId) ?? 0) + quantity); emitUpdate.\n- setLowStockThreshold: thresholds.set(productId, threshold). No event, no check.\n- Events.INVENTORY_UPDATED = 'inventory:updated'; Event